          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਟਲਣਾ (ṭalṇā) is inherited from Sanskrit ṭalati, \"moves aside\" (a sense CDIAL infers); CDIAL lists Punjabi ṭalṇā, \"to slip away\", under it (CDIAL 5450). CDIAL does not give the sense \"to back out\"."
            }
